---
description: Shell used by entrypoint and secret setup
globs: "**/*.sh,scripts/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

- entrypoint.sh and init-secrets.sh are POSIX sh. Use set -eu. Do not add bash-only syntax.
- Quote every expansion. No eval. Secrets are copied to /run/console-secrets for uid 10001. Do not print file contents.
- init-secrets.sh creates missing files mode 600 and never overwrites an existing secret.
- Shell only copies files, drops privileges, or writes a secret. Application logic stays in Python.
